<p>To help with testing your integration, we have built a Test mode into ev=
ery store.</p>
<p>When you sign up to Lemon Squeezy, your store is in Test mode by default=
, and once your store is activated the Live mode gets turned on.</p>
<p>When Test mode is active, your Lemon Squeezy account changes into a test=
 environment competely separate from your live store, with separate product=
s, customers and purchases.</p>
